    "recognition-original",
    "acquisition-original",
    "validation-fresh-copy",
    "acquisition-after-successful-validation"
  ],
  "secondPass": "Explicit only on three wrapper cases, using the first validation mutated prompt and a fresh validated cache through validate_prompt; reported separately.",
  "comparison": "Typed JSON observations preserve bool/int/float distinction, float64 bits, dict order, missing versus null, list versus tuple. No numeric tolerance and no blanket API parity verdict.",
  "sanitization": "Traceback arrays inside source validation errors become a declared omitted-frame-count object. All other public fixture values and error messages are retained. No private paths or source stacks are published.",
